~ random_chatter
# Fallback only. companion.gd now picks topics itself with shuffle bags,
# so nothing repeats until everything else has played.
%4 => ramble_hub
%2 => question_hub
%1 => chat_remember
%1 => chat_personality_check
%1 => invite_tictactoe

# ==============================================================================
# HUBS (fallback only, companion.gd calls the topics below directly)
