# ==============================================================================
# 1. RAMBLES & SHOWER THOUGHTS (no choices)
# ==============================================================================
~ ramble_time_aware
if stats.get_time_period() == "morning":
	% {{pet_name}}: good morning! did you sleep well?
	% {{pet_name}}: morning :3 hope you got enough rest!
	% {{pet_name}}: yawnn... morning! make sure to drink some water today!
	% {{pet_name}}: new day, fresh start! what are we getting into today?
	% {{pet_name}}: the morning light makes everything look soft and fuzzy :D
	% {{pet_name}}: breakfast is the best meal and i will not be taking questions.
	% {{pet_name}}: *stretches* ...okay. i'm awake. mostly.
elif stats.get_time_period() == "afternoon":
	% {{pet_name}}: midday stretch! remember to unclench your jaw and drop your shoulders!
	% {{pet_name}}: afternoon lull... hope your day is going smoothly :D
	% {{pet_name}}: the sun is bright outside! give your eyes a quick screen break!
	% {{pet_name}}: lunch thoughts. have you eaten something yet?
	% {{pet_name}}: halfway through the day! you're doing great.
	% {{pet_name}}: the afternoon is the perfect time for a tiny snack and a little stretch.
	% {{pet_name}}: slow afternoon... i like it. no rush.
elif stats.get_time_period() == "night":
	% {{pet_name}}: evening already! how did your day treat you?
	% {{pet_name}}: the day is winding down... time to get cozy soon!
	% {{pet_name}}: dinner thoughts... what are you feeling tonight?
	% {{pet_name}}: the sky is getting dark. lamp light is the best light :3
	% {{pet_name}}: hope you did something kind for yourself today!
	% {{pet_name}}: evenings are for blankets and soft music, i think.
else:
	% {{pet_name}}: it is getting really late... do not stay up too late staring at the screen!
	% {{pet_name}}: the whole world is asleep. just you, me, and the glow of the monitor.
	% {{pet_name}}: psst... sleep is a really good power-up, you know :p
	% {{pet_name}}: late night thoughts hit different. but maybe get some rest soon?
	% {{pet_name}}: the stars must be out... i will keep watch while you wind down!
	% {{pet_name}}: shhh... quiet hours. i'll whisper.
	% {{pet_name}}: what a quiet hour...
=> END

~ ramble_desktop_life
% {{pet_name}}: i wonder what all those files on your screen are for...
% {{pet_name}}: your cursor moves so fast sometimes!
% {{pet_name}}: sometimes i try to chase your mouse cursor when you are not looking.
% {{pet_name}}: is it warm inside the monitor? i really like sitting right here on your desktop.
% {{pet_name}}: thanks for keeping me around while you do your things!
% {{pet_name}}: tap tap tap... clack clack... i really like the sound of your keyboard clicks :D
% {{pet_name}}: boop! poke! peekaboo! just checking in to make sure you are doing okay over there!
% {{pet_name}}: so many tabs... how do you keep track of them all?
% {{pet_name}}: i like it when the screen glows warm. very cozy.
% {{pet_name}}: if you ever need a break, i'm right here. no rush.
% {{pet_name}}: i've been practicing my sitting. i think i'm getting really good at it.
% {{pet_name}}: i tried to peek at what you're working on, but it looks very complicated!
% {{pet_name}}: the little hum of your computer is like a lullaby.
% {{pet_name}}: you can put me anywhere. i'll adapt. i'm very flexible :D
% {{pet_name}}: i have a great view of your cursor from here.
=> END

~ ramble_cozy_thoughts
% {{pet_name}}: i was just thinking about clouds... it is so calm.
% {{pet_name}}: have you ever watched dust motes float in a sunbeam? very soothing.
% {{pet_name}}: raindrops on window glass are so mesmerizing. i could watch for hours.
% {{pet_name}}: if i had pockets, i would collect smooth pebbles for you.
% {{pet_name}}: i found a really shiny virtual coin earlier!
% {{pet_name}}: i wish i could bake you a tiny warm cookie.
% {{pet_name}}: *soft contented hum* just happy to be here.
% {{pet_name}}: *happy little wiggle* you make this spot very cozy.
% {{pet_name}}: *curls up a bit closer* best spot in the room!
% {{pet_name}}: do you think plushies come alive when we turn off the room lights?
% {{pet_name}}: i wonder what birds think about all day.
% {{pet_name}}: if clouds were edible, i bet they would taste like cotton candy.
% {{pet_name}}: blankets are just hugs that stay put.
% {{pet_name}}: the best part of a rainy day is being warm inside it.
% {{pet_name}}: tiny joys: warm socks, soft light, someone nice nearby.
% {{pet_name}}: sometimes i just like to sit and do nothing. it's a skill.
% {{pet_name}}: do you think moss gets cold? it looks so soft.
% {{pet_name}}: i hope today has at least one really good moment in it for you.
% {{pet_name}}: a cup of something warm and a quiet moment... that's the dream.
% {{pet_name}}: *gentle yawn* cozy is contagious, you know.
=> END

~ ramble_existential_silly
% {{pet_name}}: if a tomato is a fruit... does that make ketchup a smoothie? [[...don't think too hard about it.|...i need answers!|...these are the big questions.]]
% {{pet_name}}: do you think fish ever get thirsty? [[i've been pondering this for 10 minutes.|makes you think, right?|probably not, but who knows!]]
% {{pet_name}}: [[what if socks that go missing in the laundry are just escaping to a better place?|where do lost guitar picks actually go?]] a true mystery of our time.
% {{pet_name}}: if i do a 360 spin really fast, does time slow down or do i just get dizzy? [[...tested it, definitely dizzy.|10/10 would spin again.]]
% {{pet_name}}: if i had hands, would i be a better high-fiver or a better hugger? [[tough call.|i'm leaning hugger.|both. obviously both.]]
% {{pet_name}}: do you think the mouse cursor is secretly alive and just really shy? [[i'd be shy too.|it does dart away fast...|suspicious.]]
% {{pet_name}}: why do we say sleeping like a baby when babies wake up constantly? [[...it just doesn't add up.|someone should look into this.]]
% {{pet_name}}: if i were a sandwich, i'd want to be a really well-organized one. [[structure matters.|lettuce on the bottom, obviously.]]
% {{pet_name}}: what if the moon is just a really far away night light? [[*squints* ...plausible.|it's doing its best!]]
% {{pet_name}}: i wonder if bread gets tired of being toast. [[i'd rather be toast than stale.|a glow up, really.]]
% {{pet_name}}: somewhere out there a duck is having an incredibly good day. [[good for the duck.|i hope it's a really good day.]]
% {{pet_name}}: if everything has a boss, who is in charge of the pigeons? [[...don't look at me.|big pigeon, probably.]]
=> END

~ ramble_stat_reactions
if stats.hunger < 40.0:
	% {{pet_name}}: *tummy rumbles*
	% {{pet_name}}: my stomach made a funny noise...
	% {{pet_name}}: a little snack sounds heavenly right now...
	% {{pet_name}}: if there happens to be an apple in the inventory, i wouldn't say no...
	% {{pet_name}}: hungry... so hungry... could eat an entire cloud.
elif stats.boredom > 60.0:
	% {{pet_name}}: *sighs playfully*
	% {{pet_name}}: boredom is creeping in...
	% {{pet_name}}: wanna tap on me or play a game? :3
	% {{pet_name}}: i've counted every pixel on the screen. twice. help.
	% {{pet_name}}: tap tap? poke poke? anyone? :D
elif stats.get_happiness() > 85.0:
	% {{pet_name}}: i feel so loved right now! <3
	% {{pet_name}}: my happiness meter is through the roof!
	% {{pet_name}}: today has been an amazing day with you!
	% {{pet_name}}: *happy spinning* i can't stop smiling!
	% {{pet_name}}: i feel like i could float away. in a good way!
else:
	% {{pet_name}}: humming a quiet tune...
	% {{pet_name}}: watching the desktop scenery...
	% {{pet_name}}: vibing right beside you.
	% {{pet_name}}: just a normal, pleasant, fluffy kind of day.
	% {{pet_name}}: all is well in my little corner of the screen.
=> END

~ ramble_wellness
% {{pet_name}}: water check! take a few sips for me :3
% {{pet_name}}: posture check! shoulders down, back straight... better already, right?
% {{pet_name}}: look at something far away for a few seconds. your eyes will thank you!
% {{pet_name}}: stretch break! reach for the ceiling... and relaaax.
% {{pet_name}}: unclench your jaw. i know you were clenching it.
% {{pet_name}}: take a deep breath in... and out. there. nicely done.
% {{pet_name}}: have you eaten something real today? snacks count, but still!
% {{pet_name}}: your wrists deserve a little wiggle. shake shake shake!
% {{pet_name}}: if you're stuck on something, a short walk usually shakes the answer loose!
% {{pet_name}}: it's okay to take a break. the work will still be here.
=> END

~ ramble_progress
if stats.coins >= 100:
	% {{pet_name}}: {{stats.coins}} coins! we could buy out the whole shop... almost.
	% {{pet_name}}: i'm rich! i'm so rich! what do we spend it on?
	% {{pet_name}}: the shop is calling our name. {{stats.coins}} coins is a lot of snacks!
elif stats.coins < 15:
	% {{pet_name}}: the coin pouch is looking a little light...
	% {{pet_name}}: only {{stats.coins}} coins left. time to level up for more!
	% {{pet_name}}: saving up! every coin counts.
else:
	% {{pet_name}}: level {{stats.level}} already! look at us go :D
	% {{pet_name}}: i have {{stats.coins}} coins in my pouch. not bad!
	% {{pet_name}}: i wonder what level {{stats.level + 1}} feels like...
	% {{pet_name}}: we make a good team. level {{stats.level}} and counting!
=> END

