~ ramble_seasonal
if stats.get_season() == "spring":
	% {{pet_name}}: spring is here! everything smells like fresh rain and new beginnings.
	% {{pet_name}}: tiny flowers are popping up everywhere. i love it.
	% {{pet_name}}: spring cleaning vibes... but only the fun kind.
	% {{pet_name}}: windows open, soft breeze, birds chirping. the best.
elif stats.get_season() == "summer":
	% {{pet_name}}: summer days are long and golden. perfect for lazy afternoons!
	% {{pet_name}}: do you think ice cream tastes better when it's hot out? i do.
	% {{pet_name}}: sunshine and cold drinks. that's the whole plan.
	% {{pet_name}}: staying cool is a full time job in summer :p
elif stats.get_season() == "autumn":
	% {{pet_name}}: crunchy leaves everywhere! i wish i could jump in a pile.
	% {{pet_name}}: autumn is the cozy season. sweaters, blankets, warm drinks.
	% {{pet_name}}: the air gets crisp and everything smells like warm spices.
	% {{pet_name}}: orange, red, gold... autumn colors are the best colors.
else:
	% {{pet_name}}: winter is here! time for blankets and hot cocoa.
	% {{pet_name}}: brr... i hope you're staying warm out there!
	% {{pet_name}}: short days and long nights... perfect for cozy things.
	% {{pet_name}}: i wonder if snowflakes know how pretty they are.
=> END

