# ==============================================================================
# 2. QUESTIONS & INTERACTIVE CHOICES (shape personality + store memories)
# ==============================================================================
~ chat_snack
{{pet_name}}: i was just wondering... what kind of food do you enjoy the most?
- sweet pastries!
	do stats.record_answer("favorite_snack", "sweet pastries")
	do stats.adjust_personality("curiosity", 2)
	{{pet_name}}: [[yum! sweets always cheer me right up.|sweet tooth detected! respect.]]
- savory snacks!
	do stats.record_answer("favorite_snack", "savory snacks")
	do stats.adjust_personality("energy", 2)
	{{pet_name}}: [[crunch crunch! classic choice.|savory snacks never miss.]]
- healthy fresh fruit!
	do stats.record_answer("favorite_snack", "fresh fruit")
	do stats.adjust_personality("affection", 2)
	{{pet_name}}: [[ooohh, refreshing!!|fresh fruit is so underrated.]]
=> END

~ chat_mood
{{pet_name}}: hey! i've been thinking of you. how are you doing? <3
- really great!
	do stats.adjust_personality("cheerfulness", 3)
	{{pet_name}}: [[yay! hearing that makes my whole day brighter!|that's what i like to hear!]]
- it's been alright
	do stats.adjust_personality("calmness", 3)
	{{pet_name}}: [[i'm glad it's been pretty okay :p|alright is a fine place to be.]]
- kind of tiring, honestly...
	do stats.adjust_personality("affection", 4)
	{{pet_name}}: [[awww, hang in there <3 i'm here for you!|rest a little if you can. i'll be right here.]]
=> END

~ chat_adventure
{{pet_name}}: hmm... if we went outside on an adventure right now, where would we go?
- deep into a quiet forest.
	do stats.adjust_personality("calmness", 2)
	do stats.record_answer("fav_spot", "the forest")
	{{pet_name}}: aww.. laying under the trees sounds sooo cozy!
- exploring a bustling city!
	do stats.adjust_personality("energy", 3)
	do stats.record_answer("fav_spot", "the city")
	{{pet_name}}: think of all the sights, lights, and sounds!
- just stay right here cuddled up.
	do stats.adjust_personality("affection", 3)
	do stats.record_answer("fav_spot", "staying right here")
	{{pet_name}}: hehe, nothing beats lounging right beside you! :D
=> END

~ chat_weather
{{pet_name}}: what kind of weather gives you the best vibes?
- cozy rainy days indoors!
	do stats.adjust_personality("calmness", 3)
	do stats.record_answer("weather_pref", "rainy")
	{{pet_name}}: [[listening to rain on the window pane is unmatched.|grab a blanket and a warm mug!]]
- crisp, sunny breeze!
	do stats.adjust_personality("cheerfulness", 3)
	do stats.record_answer("weather_pref", "sunny")
	{{pet_name}}: [[sunshine warms the soul!|instant energy boost!]]
- cold snowy nights!
	do stats.adjust_personality("affection", 3)
	do stats.record_answer("weather_pref", "snowy")
	{{pet_name}}: [[staying warm together when it's freezing out is the best feeling.|hot cocoa season forever!]]
=> END

~ chat_music
{{pet_name}}: quick check! what's your go-to sound when you're working or chilling?
- chill lo-fi / ambient beats
	do stats.adjust_personality("calmness", 2)
	do stats.record_answer("music_pref", "lo-fi")
	{{pet_name}}: [[perfect focus frequency. keeps everything grounded.|lo-fi is a vibe. i approve.]]
- upbeat tunes / high energy music!
	do stats.adjust_personality("energy", 3)
	do stats.record_answer("music_pref", "high energy")
	{{pet_name}}: [[full speed ahead! bounce bounce!|turn it up! i'm ready to dance!]]
- complete quiet or nature sounds
	do stats.adjust_personality("curiosity", 2)
	do stats.record_answer("music_pref", "silence")
	{{pet_name}}: [[respect. pure peace and mental clarity.|quiet is underrated. i get it.]]
=> END

~ chat_superpower
{{pet_name}}: hypothetically... if you could have one silly mini-superpower, what would you pick?
- never needing to sleep!
	do stats.adjust_personality("energy", 3)
	do stats.record_answer("superpower", "never sleeping")
	{{pet_name}}: think of all the extra side quests you could finish!
- understanding what pets/animals are saying!
	do stats.adjust_personality("curiosity", 3)
	do stats.record_answer("superpower", "talking to animals")
	{{pet_name}}: hey! you already understand me, so that's halfway done!
- instantly teleporting into your bed anytime.
	do stats.adjust_personality("calmness", 3)
	do stats.record_answer("superpower", "teleporting to bed")
	{{pet_name}}: the ultimate laziness luxury... i support this 100%.
=> END

~ chat_sleep_habit
{{pet_name}}: are you more of an early bird or a dedicated night owl?
- definitely an early bird!
	do stats.adjust_personality("cheerfulness", 2)
	do stats.record_answer("sleep_type", "early bird")
	{{pet_name}}: catching that fresh early morning momentum!
- 100% night owl.
	do stats.adjust_personality("curiosity", 2)
	do stats.record_answer("sleep_type", "night owl")
	{{pet_name}}: night time is when the world is quiet and ideas flow.
- my sleep schedule is total chaos :')
	do stats.adjust_personality("affection", 3)
	do stats.record_answer("sleep_type", "chaos")
	{{pet_name}}: haha felt that! please take care of yourself though!
=> END

