	% {{pet_name}}: crunchy leaves and cozy sweaters... you have such good taste.
else:
	% {{pet_name}}: winter is yours. blankets and snowfall, i remember.
	% {{pet_name}}: i keep thinking about snowy mornings because of you.
=> END

~ remember_comfort_food
if stats.player_answers["comfort_food"] == "soup":
	% {{pet_name}}: soup for bad days, right? i hope today is a soup-optional day.
	% {{pet_name}}: i'm glad you have soup when you need it.
elif stats.player_answers["comfort_food"] == "something sweet":
	% {{pet_name}}: something sweet when things are rough. i still think that's a great plan.
	% {{pet_name}}: if today is hard, i'd say dessert is fully justified.
else:
	% {{pet_name}}: pasta is your comfort food! i'd cook for you if i had hands.
	% {{pet_name}}: if today is a bad day, i vote pasta.
=> END

# ==============================================================================
# 8. TYPED QUESTIONS: the player types an answer (see queue_text in companion.gd)
#    The answer is in {{last_text}} for the "reply_*" title that plays right after,
#    and later in stats.player_notes["<key>"].
# ==============================================================================
~ type_nickname
{{pet_name}}: i realized i've never asked... what should i call you?
- let me type it!
	do queue_text("nickname")
	{{pet_name}}: ooh, okay! go ahead :3
- not sure yet
	{{pet_name}}: [[no rush! tell me whenever.|that's okay! i'll ask again later.]]
=> END

~ type_hobby
{{pet_name}}: what's something you do just because you enjoy it? a hobby, a habit, anything.
- let me tell you!
	do queue_text("hobby")
	{{pet_name}}: yay, i love this. go ahead!
- hmm, not right now
	{{pet_name}}: [[okay! i'll ask again sometime.|no worries. think about it!]]
=> END

~ type_fav_food
{{pet_name}}: what's a meal you could eat any day and never get tired of?
- i'll type it!
	do queue_text("fav_food")
	{{pet_name}}: ooh, i'm so curious. go on!
- can't decide
	{{pet_name}}: [[valid. that's a hard one.|that's okay! i'll ask again later.]]
=> END

~ type_today_goal
{{pet_name}}: is there one thing you want to get done today? even something small.
- yes, let me tell you
	do queue_text("today_goal")
	{{pet_name}}: okay! i'll cheer for you. go ahead.
- just taking it easy today
	{{pet_name}}: [[taking it easy is a goal too.|rest counts! i'm proud of you anyway.]]
=> END

~ type_comfort_place
{{pet_name}}: if you could be anywhere right now, a real place or an imaginary one, where would it be?
- let me describe it!
	do queue_text("comfort_place")
	{{pet_name}}: ooh, i'm listening. go ahead!
- i don't know
	{{pet_name}}: [[that's okay. maybe it's somewhere you haven't found yet.|no pressure! i'll ask another time.]]
=> END

~ type_proud
{{pet_name}}: tell me something you did recently that you're a little proud of.
- let me type it!
	do queue_text("proud_of")
	{{pet_name}}: yes! i want to hear everything.
- nothing comes to mind
	{{pet_name}}: [[showing up counts. i'm proud of you for that.|i bet there's something. i'll ask again later.]]
=> END

~ type_fav_show
{{pet_name}}: what's a show, book, or game you can't stop thinking about lately?
- let me tell you!
	do queue_text("fav_show")
	{{pet_name}}: ooh, okay! recommend me something!
- nothing right now
	{{pet_name}}: [[that's okay! maybe soon.|okay! i'll ask again later.]]
=> END

~ type_birthday_wish
{{pet_name}}: random question: what would be your perfect birthday present? it can be silly!
- here's my wish!
	do queue_text("birthday_wish")
	{{pet_name}}: okay okay okay, i'm taking notes!
- surprise me
	{{pet_name}}: [[challenge accepted!|i'll think about it. very hard. with my fluffy brain.]]
=> END

~ type_pet_name_idea
{{pet_name}}: if i had a pet of my own, what do you think i should name it?
- let me name it!
	do queue_text("name_idea")
	{{pet_name}}: ooh, naming rights! go ahead.
- no idea
	{{pet_name}}: [[that's fair. naming things is hard.|i'll think of something too!]]
=> END

~ type_mind
{{pet_name}}: anything on your mind you want to tell me? it can be big or small. i'm all ears.
- yeah, let me type it
	do queue_text("mind")
	{{pet_name}}: i'm here. take your time.
- not really, just hanging out
	{{pet_name}}: [[that's totally fine. just hanging out is good too.|okay! i'm here if that changes.]]
=> END

# --- replies: they play right after the player typed something ({{last_text}} = what was typed) ---
~ reply_skip
% {{pet_name}}: no problem! we can talk about it another time.
