# ==============================================================================
# 9. MISSING A FRIEND (stage 2): the pet remembers a pet it met in multiplayer.
#    companion.gd (_begin_miss_topic) fills miss_line / miss_yes / miss_later / miss_memory /
#    miss_follow_up from pet_memory.gd, depending on how the pet feels about that friend
#    (sweetheart, crush, best friend, friend, met once, on bad terms).
#    "do queue_invite()" opens the Friends tab + the Steam invite dialog once the balloon is gone.
# ==============================================================================
~ miss_friend
{{pet_name}}: {{miss_line}}
- yes, let's invite them!
	do queue_invite()
	do stats.adjust_personality("affection", 2)
	{{pet_name}}: {{miss_yes}}
- when did you last see them?
	{{pet_name}}: {{miss_memory}}
	=> miss_follow_up
- maybe later
	{{pet_name}}: {{miss_later}}
=> END

~ miss_follow_up
{{pet_name}}: {{miss_follow_up}}
- yes, let's invite them!
	do queue_invite()
	do stats.adjust_personality("affection", 2)
	{{pet_name}}: {{miss_yes}}
- not right now
	{{pet_name}}: {{miss_later}}
=> END